  {"id":"EsthGr","name":"Esther (Greek)","chapters":10,"testament":"OT","beyond":{"canons":["catholic","orthodox","anglican"],"text":"web","note":"Esther translated from the Greek, with the passages the Hebrew lacks in square brackets. The World English Bible sets them at 1:1 and after 3:13, 4:17, 8:12 and 10:3, so its verse numbers match the Hebrew Esther, not editions that print them as chapters 11–16."}},
